%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3DDLV-003> |\n| DLV-004 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Method Configuration | The system will configure the applicable delivery methods for the EU domestic storefront in SFCC Business Manager, including Ground, Express, Next Day, Same Day, Collect in Boutique, and International, with costs and thresholds configured per Zimmermann's confirmed rate card. | Accenture | EU Domestic | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-004> |\n| DLV-005 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Method Configuration | The system will configure each delivery method in SFCC Business Manager with a unique ID, customer-facing name, description, tax class, and currency, independently per storefront. | Accenture | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-005> |\n| DLV-006 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Method Configuration | The system will allow business users to enable or disable individual delivery methods per storefront via SFCC Business Manager without requiring a developer deployment. | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-006> |\n| DLV-007 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Method Configuration | The system will designate one default delivery method per storefront per currency in SFCC Business Manager; the default method will be pre-selected at the delivery step of checkout. | Accenture | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Config | Confirmed | We should have the ablity to change to a new default option if we need to disable the default one temporarily - confirmed configurable | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-007> |\n| DLV-008 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Method Configuration | The system will configure Collect in Boutique as a shipping method with the Store Pickup Enabled flag activated in SFCC Business Manager, enabling the boutique selection flow at checkout. | Accenture | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-008> |\n| DLV-009 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Estimated Delivery Date | The system will display a dynamic estimated delivery date (Narvar widget) window alongside each delivery method at the checkout delivery step (e.g. \"Estimated Delivery: Mon 12 May – Wed 14 May\"). | Accenture | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-009> |\n| DLV-010 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Estimated Delivery Date | The system will not support customer-selectable delivery date or time-slot selection at checkout at go-live; estimated delivery windows will be display-only and not customer-configurable. | Accenture | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-010> |\n| DLV-011 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Cost Configuration | The system will support value-based tiered shipping costs per delivery method, configurable per storefront in SFCC Business Manager. | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK (domestic), EU (domestic), US (domestic) | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20DLV-011> |\n| DLV-012 | Checkout Flow & Delivery | Delivery Cost Configuration | The system will support a configurable free 