{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "339869711",
    "title": "7. Shipping Methods",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/339869711",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 2,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nShipping methods in BM control what options appear at checkout. Demo and RefArch shipping methods must be removed before production. Given Zimmermann's complex regional fulfilment model (AU warehouse, Belgium warehouse, US 3PL, UK 3PL, boutique ship-from-store) this requires careful per-site verification.\n\n**📎 Salesforce Reference:** [Validate Ordering Configuration — Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/b2c-solution-functional-launch-readiness/b2c-review-business-manager)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [Shipping Methods in Business Manager](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/Ordering/ShippingMethods.html)\n\n**⚠️ Risk note:** Incorrect or missing shipping methods are the most visible launch-day failure — they block checkout. Verify on a per-site basis against actual carrier contracts.\n\n---\n\nChecklist\n---------\n\n### Global Cleanup\n\nincompleteAll demo / RefArch test shipping methods **removed** from all sites\nincompleteNo shipping method with \"test\", \"demo\", or \"sample\" in the name remains\n\n### AU Shipping Methods (Shippit / StarShipit)\n\nincompleteStandard domestic shipping method configured and visible at checkout\nincompleteExpress shipping method configured (if offered)\nincompleteBOPIS / Click & Collect shipping method configured and visible\nincompleteCarrier credentials pointing to production Shippit account (not sandbox)\n\n### UK Shipping Methods (Ordoro / DHL)\n\nincompleteStandard domestic shipping configured\nincompleteExpress/next day shipping configured (if offered)\nincompleteCarrier credentials pointing to production Ordoro/DHL account\n\n### US Domestic Shipping Methods (Ordoro / FedEx)\n\nincompleteStandard domestic shipping configured\nincompleteExpress shipping configured (if offered)\nincompleteCarrier credentials pointing to production accounts\n\n### EU Domestic Shipping Methods (Ordoro / DHL — Belgium warehouse)\n\nincompleteStandard EU domestic shipping configured\nincompletePer-country shipping rules configured where required\n\n### ME Shipping Methods (Spanish boutique fulfilment)\n\nincompleteME shipping methods configured reflecting current fulfilment from Spanish boutiques\nincompleteLong-term fulfilment model for ME is not yet finalised — flag if shipping config is placeholder\n\n### Global-e International Storefronts\n\nincompleteUS Intl and EU Intl shipping methods correctly handled by Global-e (not SFCC native shipping)\nincompleteSFCC shipping method for Global-e redirect configured correctly (shopper redirected to Global-e checkout)\n\n### BOPIS / Click & Collect\n\nincompleteBOPIS shipping method configured and linked to store locator\nincompleteStore pickup address display working at checkout\nincompleteBOPIS toggle working correctly in PWA Kit (pickup-or-delivery component)\n\n\n---\n\nNotes / Findings\n----------------\n\n*Record gaps, decisions, and owner for remediation here.*\n\n| Finding | Severity | Owner | Resolved |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f69a",
    "page_width": "full-width"
  }
}"}

